    "resume": "This study investigates the relationship between glaucoma and retinal fluorescence lifetimes using FLIO. The results show that participants with glaucoma have shorter mean lifetimes compared to those without glaucoma, even after adjusting for age and diabetes status. The study suggests that glaucoma may be associated with altered metabolic activity in the retina.",
